*MCR22-8 MCE 4-30-97
*Ref: Motorola Thyristor Device Data, Q2/95
*600V 2A pkg:TO-92B 1,2,3
.SUBCKT MCR22-8  1 2 3
*    TERMINALS:  A G K
QP  6 4 1  POUT OFF
QN  4 6 5  NOUT OFF
RF  6 4    120MEG
RR  1 4    80MEG
RGK 6 5    240
RG  2 6    24.4
RK  3 5    0.18
DF  6 4    ZF
DR  1 4    ZR
DGK 6 5    ZGK
.MODEL ZF   D (IS=6E-16 IBV=1U BV=600)
.MODEL ZR   D (IS=6E-16 IBV=1U BV=600)
.MODEL ZGK  D (IS=6E-16 IBV=1U BV=5)
.MODEL POUT PNP (IS=600F BF=1 CJE=134P TF=11U)
.MODEL NOUT NPN (IS=600F BF=100 RC=0.72 CJE=670P CJC=134P TF=736N)
